# Mini Template

Dependency-free TypeScript template renderer for Bun.

```ts
import { render } from "./src/engine";
render("Hello, {{name}}!", { name: "Ada & Bob" });
```

Use `{{path}}` for escaped values, `{{{path}}}` for raw values, `{{#if path}}...{{else}}...{{/if}}`, and `{{#each items}}...{{/each}}`. Inside `each`, `{{this}}` and `{{@index}}` are available. The CLI is `bun run src/cli.ts TEMPLATE_FILE DATA.json`.
